# W9, guest b (k2, own phase 2): joins a in stag0101; alone there after a went into dng101b1, it departs into stagML02
# point 1 (the records of staggf03's math00, the Fortress's way into stagML02, posted by the development build's depart
# action: the explore bot's characters did not survive the Fortress), a home stage its own story is not at: the DISSOLVE
# redirects it to stagML11 point 3 on its own story (19.8.3; every guest counts as not in step).
